OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venues raise fears over
OL,4,Arailway plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusic venues in part of Birmingham have
OL,7,Fheld an event to raise concerns about
OL,8,Fplans to alter a nearby railway
OL,9,Fviaduct.
OL,11,FThey claim the proposed work to the
OL,12,Fline into Moor Street station would
OL,13,Fthreaten their businesses, with at
OL,14,Fleast one earmarked for demolition.
OL,16,FThe Midlands Rail Hub project is aimed
OL,17,Fat allowing more trains into Moor
OL,18,FStreet instead of the congested New
OL,19,FStreet station and construction could
OL,20,Fbegin in 2030.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
