OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venues raise fears over
OL,4,Arailway plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Midlands Rail Hub Alliance, which
OL,7,Fis coordinating the plans, said the
OL,8,Fviaduct would need to be widened and
OL,9,FDigbeth's cultural scene would benefit
OL,10,Ffrom extra trains.
